sequenceDiagram
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Pool as Equipment pool

  API->>DB: Begin transaction
  DB->>Pool: Lock bucket or serialized item
  Pool->>Pool: Check occupied range and active quantity
  alt Available
    Pool-->>DB: Create hold and increment held quantity
    DB-->>API: Commit
  else Unavailable
    DB-->>API: Roll back with inventory conflict
  end
  Note over DB,Pool: Expiration releases idempotently
